doc:proceedingPoliceOfficerEvidence a echr:DomesticProceeding ;
    rdfs:label "evidence of a police officer and judge's hearsay direction"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:followsProceeding doc:proceedingSiteVisitDomachevo ;
    echr:hasInstanceLevel echr:LevelFirstInstance ;
    echr:hasParticipation doc:participation_police_applicant_1,
        doc:participation_police_prosecution_1 ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "During the evidence of a police officer, counsel for the applicant posed questions concerning the applicant’s claim that he had served in the Polish Free Army and reference was made to Polish military records which were never formally proved but which by agreement were before the jury. The police officer also made reference to a missing persons document, obtained from German records, which referred to the applicant as going missing from a Waffen SS unit in late November 1944. This document had not been put in evidence. The judge directed the jury that hearsay was not evidence, that the document to which the officer had referred had not been prepared by him and that, accordingly, the document was not evidence."^^xsd:string .

